:"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2265"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T06:18:50-07:00","id":985375,"title":"","content":"I pleased things are moving onto the next stage. It makes sense to deal with the little stuff during the errata pass.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T10:37:35-07:00","id":985500,"title":"","content":"So okay does that mean its going to be in editing next week? I'm not sure where in the process this fits. Does it count as proofing (whatever that is).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T13:29:28-07:00","id":985632,"title":"","content":"Proofing is completely different and happens just before it goes to press (or available for being printed on demand by the public) <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prepress_proofing\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prepress_proofing</a> I can't help with the rest of your question though...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10769-llegume","name":"LLegume","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"94"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T14:14:05-07:00","id":985666,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LLegume</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/985239-very-minor-but-also-major-update?p=985632#post985632\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Proofing is completely different and happens just before it goes to press (or available for being printed on demand by the public) <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prepress_proofing\" target=\"_blank\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Prepress_proofing</a> I can't help with the rest of your question though...</div> </div> </div> </div> Thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T18:06:28-07:00","id":985829,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omegaphallic</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/985239-very-minor-but-also-major-update?p=985500#post985500\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So okay does that mean its going to be in editing next week? I'm not sure where in the process this fits. Does it count as proofing (whatever that is).</div> </div> </div> </div>It's not proofing. <br /> <br /> So, what happens basically, is I send it to my Onyx Path overlords. If they need me to change anything, they send it to me and I do that. If they dig it as-is, then they send it to their White Wolf overlords. Likewise, if they want me to change anything, they send it to me and I do that. If they dig it as-is, then we send it to editing. <br /> <br /> As soon as it goes to editing, it also goes to art direction. That's basically where they start ordering art to accommodate the book. Once it's done in editing, it gets sent back to me. I accept or reject various edits, then send the final text over to layout. They do layout, and send it back to me to do a digital proof pass. That means I look at the PDF and see if there's anything that stands out to me that needs fixing. Once it's done with digital proofs, then it goes live for sale. <br /> <br /> After it goes for sale, we do errata and public comments. We integrate those over the following weeks. Once integrated, we order a physical proof, and Rich or Mike or whomever does a physical proof pass, where they look for lingering issues, ink saturation problems, page cut problems, all that jazz. They fix it, and order another one. Assuming that one's okay, they put the physical book live for sale. <br /> <br /> I hope that clarifies.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T18:16:56-07:00","id":985836,"title":"","content":"In essence, the whole process can take up to three months (or more) to reach the digital purchase phase, if I remember correctly.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T19:15:17-07:00","id":985884,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Malus</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/985239-very-minor-but-also-major-update?p=985836#post985836\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">In essence, the whole process can take up to three months (or more) to reach the digital purchase phase, if I remember correctly.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's probably a good average. I know I have a couple of books right now sitting on about six or so months in that phase. So it's hard to say. But I feel like Changeling will be prioritized a bit, since it's a core book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-11T19:50:50-07:00","id":985899,"title":"","content":"Changeling arriving early next year would be pretty brilliant.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/904596-geniuses-and-gramarie\" target=\"_blank\">Genius templates</a>: Super Science Mini-Template for Demon: the Descent<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1337874-oracle-the-endbringers-fan-splat\" target=\"_blank\">Oracle the Endbringers</a>: Time-Manipulator Fan-Splat","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8331-milo-v3","name":"milo v3","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8331_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T03:22:46-07:00","id":986022,"title":"","content":"From what I understand, other corebooks in this phase took at least 6 months to get to Advanced PDF version. <b>Werewolf</b> 2E took 9 months, <b>Mage</b> 2E took almost the year, <b>Promethean</b> 2E only 6 months. Seeing how <b>Changeling</b> set's art of it's books it will take rather longer than shorter amount of time...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T05:25:54-07:00","id":986061,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/985239-very-minor-but-also-major-update?p=986022#post986022\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">From what I understand, other corebooks in this phase took at least 6 months to get to Advanced PDF version. <b>Werewolf</b> 2E took 9 months, <b>Mage</b> 2E took almost the year, <b>Promethean</b> 2E only 6 months. Seeing how <b>Changeling</b> set's art of it's books it will take rather longer than shorter amount of time...</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't know that's a good estimate. There are many, many factors that go into this. So it's hard to say. I don't want to speculate too much.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>David A Hill Jr </b><br /> Freelance Writer<br /> Independent Game Designer","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/70-machineiv","name":"MachineIV","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar70_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1791"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-10-12T07:19:28-07:00","id":986113,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MachineIV</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/985239-very-minor-but-also-major-update?p=985829#post985829\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> It's not proofing. <br /> <br /> So, what happens basically, is I send it to my Onyx Path overlords. If they need me to change anything, they send it to me and I do that. If they dig it as-is, then they send it to their White Wolf overlords. Likewise, if they want me to change anything, they send it to me and I do that. If they dig it as-is, then we send it to editing. <br /> <br /> As soon as it goes to editing, it also goes to art direction. That's basically where they start ordering art to accommodate the book. Once it's done in editing, it gets sent back to me. I accept or reject various edits, then send the final text over to layout. They do layout, and send it back to me to do a digital proof pass. That means I look at the PDF and see if there's anything that stands out to me that needs fixing. Once it's done with digital proofs, then it goes live for sale. <br /> <br /> After it goes for sale, we do errata and public comments. We integrate those over the following weeks. Once integrated, we order a physical proof, and Rich or Mike or whomever does a physical proof pass, where they look for lingering issues, ink saturation problems, page cut problems, all that jazz. They fix it, and order another one. Assuming that one's okay, they put the physical book live for sale. <br /> <br /> I hope that clarifies.</div> </div> </div> </div> Thank you, that was very informative about the process.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2241-omegaphallic","name":"Omegaphallic","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}